@baseUrl = https://localhost:7102
@email = john@example.com
@password = SecurePass@123
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### Register a user (expect 201; a repeated email returns 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Log in (copy accessToken from the response for the profile request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Get the authenticated user's profile (expect 401 without a valid token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
